OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists warned of hour-long
OL,4,Adelay after M8 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing severe delays
OL,7,Foutside Edinburgh following a crash on
OL,8,Fthe M8.
OL,10,FThe incident, close to the eastbound
OL,11,Fjunction one turnoff at Hermiston Gait,
OL,12,Fhas caused nine miles of queues and
OL,13,Fdelays of up to an hour.
OL,15,FCongestion has left traffic back up to
OL,16,FM8 junction three at Livingston and
OL,17,Fjunction 1B on the M9, while further
OL,18,Fdelays have also been reported on the
OL,19,FM90.
OL,21,FPolice Scotland has been contacted for
OL,22,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
